  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Mrs Say, straw hat manufacturer, is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Madeline%20Street">Madeline Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1872 to 1878. From 1879 she is listed as a milliner in the same street, at No. 13 from 1890, and as Mrs E. B. Say in 1895 and 1900.</p>
      <p>A Mrs Say, milliner, is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Victoria%20Street">Victoria Street</ref> in 1860 and 1861, next to William B. Say, saddler. Those listings are not linked to this entry, as it isn't clear she is the same person.</p>
      <p><hi rend="italic">This entry is a machine-assisted first draft by Common Ground, written from the directory records. Please correct or add to it.</hi></p>
    </body>
